# oxfmt's ignore file (`oxfmt --check` reads .gitignore and .prettierignore).
#
# docs/research/ holds verbatim research digests and audit transcripts kept as
# evidence for the ETHOnline submission. Reformatting them rewrites the record:
# oxfmt canonicalises GFM ambiguities in the source text (single `~` into `~~`
# strikethrough, `*` emphasis into `_`), which changes the bytes a judge reads.
docs/research/

# Idea rounds written by another tool and kept unedited for provenance.
